TestQuantizeFx.test_copy_node_has_shared_actpp_instance calls
Module.modules(remove_duplicate=False). In the 2.10.0 tag, modules() takes no
arguments; remove_duplicate exists only on named_modules(). main added the
parameter to modules() after the release, so the test and the library disagree.

